WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:13.505
Aunt Judy took the kids to the mall.

2
00:00:13.506 --> 00:00:22.809
"I want a model airplane!" Oliver said.

3
00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:28.439
The model airplanes were expensive.

4
00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:32.148
Oliver counted his money.

5
00:00:32.149 --> 00:00:36.091
He did not have enough.

6
00:00:36.092 --> 00:00:42.491
"Maybe you can buy something else," Aunt Judy said.

7
00:00:42.492 --> 00:00:49.198
"Maybe," Oliver said sadly.

8
00:00:49.199 --> 00:00:53.177
Emmy had enough money for the airplane.

9
00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:57.805
"I'll get a present for Oliver," she thought.

10
00:00:57.806 --> 00:01:02.148
She bought the airplane.

11
00:01:02.149 --> 00:01:07.779
Then Emmy saw a soccer ball.

12
00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:10.404
She counted her money.

13
00:01:10.405 --> 00:01:15.317
She did not have enough!

14
00:01:15.318 --> 00:01:21.593
Harry had enough money for the soccer ball.

15
00:01:21.594 --> 00:01:25.526
"It can be a surprise for Emmy," he thought.

16
00:01:25.527 --> 00:01:30.312
He bought the soccer ball.

17
00:01:30.313 --> 00:01:34.727
Then Harry saw a robot.

18
00:01:34.728 --> 00:01:40.460
"Just what I want!" he said.

19
00:01:40.461 --> 00:01:44.663
Harry counted his money.

20
00:01:44.664 --> 00:01:50.962
He did not have enough!

21
00:01:50.963 --> 00:01:54.337
Oliver saw the robot.

22
00:01:54.338 --> 00:01:59.352
"Harry would like that," Oliver said.

23
00:01:59.353 --> 00:02:02.117
He counted his money.

24
00:02:02.118 --> 00:02:08.460
He had enough!

25
00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:13.284
"Everyone bought something," Aunt Judy said.

26
00:02:13.285 --> 00:02:16.718
The kids held up their bags.

27
00:02:16.719 --> 00:02:23.599
"It's a present!" they all said at once.

28
00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:27.167
Everyone opened the presents.

29
00:02:27.168 --> 00:02:34.117
"Just what I wanted!" they all said.

30
00:02:34.118 --> 00:02:39.655
"Nobody got a present for Aunt Judy," Oliver said.

31
00:02:39.656 --> 00:02:44.268
"Let's buy her a present too," Emmy said.

32
00:02:44.269 --> 00:02:47.967
Aunt Judy bit into a warm pretzel.

33
00:02:47.968 --> 00:02:51.630
"Mmm," she said.

34
00:02:51.631 --> 00:03:03.532
"This is just what I wanted!"
